// transcoder.proto is the wire contract between the main open-streamer
// process and a per-stream open-streamer-transcoder subprocess.
//
// One Unix-domain socket per stream. The supervisor in
// internal/transcoder/service.go opens a bidi stream and pushes raw
// ingest TS bytes + control messages; the subprocess returns encoded
// MPEG-TS chunks per rendition + health / error events.
//
